    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic ma kisi ndelo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wodhi or ri Joisiraili, aka iwaci rijo ni joripo miyan mic paran ma cemo m'owaŋ gi mac, ma ŋwece kur mere mit i hongo ma ripo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waci rijo ni me mic ma cemo m'owaŋ gi mac ma joripo miyo Rwoth. Wot rombo ario ma jo oro acel ma jongoye gi ŋolo paka mic ma kisi ndelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod rombo acel wilamiyo odikin, aka man mere wilamiyo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo bende miyo kilo acel ma moko, m'onywow gi lita acel ma mo oliv. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me mic awaŋa ma kisi ndelo, m'iwaŋo gikululu, m'ocaki miyo gi got Sinai paka mic ma cemo, ma ŋwece kur mere sangala Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mic ma vini m'iripo miyo gi wod rombo marapena ripo bedo lita acel, m'iripo konjo i Kabedo Maleŋ ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod rombo man iripo miyo othieno gi mic ma cemo kodi mic ma vini paka m'odikin. Wiripo miyo paka mic awaŋa, ma ŋwece kur mere sangala Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic ma Sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo ma sabato wiripo miyo wot rombo ario ma jo oro acel ma jongoye gi ŋolo, kilo ario ma moko m'onywow gi mo oliv paka mic ma cemo kodi mic ma vini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me mic awaŋa ri kisi ndelo ma sabato, medo i wi mic awaŋa ma kisi ndelo kanyacel gi mic ma vini mere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic ma ndelo marapena ma dwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi ka dwe manyen cako, wiripo miyo Rwoth mic awaŋa ma rwath ario, wod rombo acel, kodi wot rombo abirio ma jo oro acel ma jongoye gi ŋolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo bende miyo paka mic ma cemo moko m'onywow gi mo oliv ri kisi rwath, kilo adek ma moko, ri wod rombo kilo ario ma moko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka ri kisi nyathi rombo ma jaoro acel, kilo acel ma moko. Mic awaŋa me obedo mic ma cemo, ma ŋwece kur mere sangala Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mic ma vini labedo lita ario ri kisi rwath, lita acel g'adec ri wod rombo, kodi lita acel ri kisi wod rombo ma jaoro acel. Me cik ri mic awaŋa ri kisi ndelo marapena ma dwe ma oro gipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo bende miyo wod diel ri Rwoth paka mic ma cwako reco medo i wi mic awaŋa ma kisi ndelo kodi mic ma vini mere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
