                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo marapena ma keco, ka wimiyo Rwoth mic ma cemo manyen i Kalima ma Keco, wiripo cokere kanyacel lamo, aka wikiripi timo tic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo Rwoth mic awaŋa, ma ŋwece kur mere sangala go. Rwath ario, wod rombo kodi wot rombo abirio ma jo oro acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mic ma cemo mere ripo bedo moko m'onywow gi mo oliv, kilo adek ri kisi rwath, kilo ario ri wod rombo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi kilo acel ri kisi wod rombo ma jaoro acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo bende miyo wod diel paka mic ma cwako reco, ma cwako reco pa ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo miyo gigipiny me kodi mic ma vini medo i wi mic awaŋa ma kisi ndelo kodi mic ma cemo. Joripo bedo ma jongoye gi ŋolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
